Z||000000||batboy||07-22-2000||02:25 AM||||I was driving down a two lane highway for work, out in God's country, way out in the middle of nowhere in western Kansas...I see this car for sale. I stop to see if it's a Fiero kit car...and if so, maybe it'll sell cheap. I looked it over real quick (nobody was home), I'll be damned if I don't think this baby is a real Dino 308. I personally know nothing about European sports cars. So...what's the Forum experts think, if it is real or not, and if so, what price would be a total bargain for a car like this that probably needs mechanical assistance? Body looks pretty good, the other side too. Interior looks decent and appears to be leather. Wow, you never know what you'll come across when on life's little journeys.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/308GTS.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 07-22-2000).]||||reg||5
